        "TileImage": "$($repository 729aa28f-5856-449a-9e41-3e4fedc5c38f).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, Agent. Following Paris, we trace the Velvet Vanguard to the coastal town of Sapienza. The syndicate is attempting to secure Ether&apos;s prototype bioweapon to bolster their militant wing.\r\rEliminate the local assets:\r• Dr. Lafayette (Profiler)\r• Roberto Vargas (Insider)\r• Sal Falcone (Fixer)\r• Torres Piombo (Smuggler)\r• Padre Francesco (Courier)\r\rNeutralize these targets to collapse their regional operations before the virus falls into Vanguard hands. Good luck.",
